  "body_html": "<h1>zProfile_choice_mem</h1>\n<h2>Lean type</h2>\n<p><code>lean\ntheorem zProfile_choice_mem [Fintype N] [Nonempty N] [Fintype A] (f : VotingRule N A) (hU : Unanimity f) (_hM : Monotonicity f) (P Q : Profile N A) (R : Set A) [∀ a : A, Decidable (a ∈ R)] (hR : R.Nonempty) {a : A} (ha : a ∈ f (zProfile P Q R)) : a ∈ R</code></p>\n<h2>Dependencies</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>VotingRule</li>\n<li>Unanimity</li>\n<li>Monotonicity</li>\n<li>Profile</li>\n<li>zProfile_prefers_inside_outside</li>\n<li>zProfile_prefers_inside</li>\n<li>StrictlyPreferred.asymm</li>\n<li>BallotPrefers.asymm</li>\n<li>Prefers.asymm</li>\n<li>Prefers</li>\n<li>IsTotal</li>\n<li>Resolute</li>\n<li>IsPositiveAffineOf.symm</li>\n<li>Indifferent.symm</li>\n<li>SWF</li>\n<li>BallotPrefers.total_of_ne</li>\n<li>Prefers.total_of_ne</li>\n<li>IIA</li>\n</ul>",
